{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/082-nv-yue-ji-ming/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/082-nv-yue-ji-ming/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 女曰鸡鸣，士曰昧旦。子兴视夜，明星有烂。将翱将翔，弋凫与雁。弋言加之，与子宜之。宜言饮酒，与子偕老。琴瑟在御，莫不静好。知子之来之，杂佩以赠之。知子之顺之，杂佩以问之。知子之好之，杂佩以报之。 · 程俊英 · 题解","description":"風 · 鄭風 · 女曰鷄鳴 · 《詩經注析》关于“女曰鸡鸣，士曰昧旦。子兴视夜，明星有烂。将翱将翔…”的注脚：程俊英、蒋见元以《女曰鸡鸣》为写贵族夫妇相警相乐的联句诗，释首章为妻劝夫早起射凫雁，次章为琴瑟宜酒、与子偕老，三章则见杂佩相赠问报，以成其德。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"082-nv-yue-ji-ming","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/082-nv-yue-ji-ming/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","poem":{"id":"082-nv-yue-ji-ming","title":"女曰鷄鳴","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhengfeng","path":["風","鄭風","女曰鷄鳴"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"女曰鸡鸣","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"士曰昧旦","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"子兴视夜","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"明星有烂","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"将翱将翔","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"弋凫与雁","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"弋言加之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"与子宜之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"宜言饮酒","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"与子偕老","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"琴瑟在御","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"莫不静好","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"知子之来之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"杂佩以赠之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"知子之顺之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"杂佩以问之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"知子之好之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"杂佩以报之","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"annotation":{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"女曰鸡鸣，士曰昧旦。子兴视夜，明星有烂。将翱将翔，弋凫与雁。弋言